# Check out every text file with LF, on every OS. The repo stores LF; a CRLF checkout on
# Windows (core.autocrlf=true) made local checks differ from Linux CI: frontmatter parsers,
# snapshot files, and the generated skills index. Local CI must match GitHub CI.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: never convert.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
